%% Compute routing — paste into https://mermaid.live
flowchart LR
  U[Work unit]
  D{Decision}

  U --> D
  D -->|small PDF / word / text| ECS[ECS Fargate Python]
  D -->|10k-page PDF batches| SFN[Step Functions map + Textract async]
  D -->|large Excel / CSV| GLUE[Glue Spark job]
  D -->|SQLite / unsplittable| ONE[Single bounded worker + spill]
  D -->|unknown size| SM[Start small, promote]

  ECS --> OUT[Silver staging prefix]
  SFN --> OUT
  GLUE --> OUT
  ONE --> OUT
  SM --> OUT
